			// hangs the target so you can see where the S side
			// (Cy_SysPm_SystemEnter{Hp,Lp,Ulp} inside the z_pm secure
			// partition) stopped. CONFIG_TFM_HALT_ON_CORE_PANIC=ON
			// (see cm33_ns/CMakeLists.txt) makes the SPE spin in
